extends RefCounted
## Skill tree content: trees and skill nodes, as plain data.
##
## Edit this file to change the tree; nothing else needs to know the ids. A
## node is learned with skill points (one per level from level 2) and gives its
## `effects` per rank. `SkillSystem` applies them.
##
## Effect stats (per rank, summed over everything learned):
##   max_hp, max_stamina, stamina_regen, walk_speed, sprint_speed   flat bonuses
##   damage_mult, crit_chance                                       fractions (0.05 = +5%)
##   gather_speed        fraction faster harvesting
##   gather_yield_chance chance of one extra mushroom per harvest
##   craft_speed         fraction faster brewing
##   craft_save_chance   chance to keep one ingredient
##   craft_bonus_chance  chance of one extra potion
##   potion_potency      fraction stronger potions
##
## Node fields: `tree`, `name`, `description`, `max_rank`, `tier` + `col` (layout,
## tier 1 is the top), `requires` (nodes that need at least one rank first),
## `min_level`, `effects`, `unlocks` (recipe ids), optional `cost` (points per
## rank, default 1). Vocation trees (a non-empty `vocation`) unlock once that
## vocation is chosen. The vocation trees below are starter placeholders.

